0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{\b\f0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
 Describe quantitative data analysis.}{\b\f0\insrsid15926043 
\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13375915 \f69\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 Quantitative data analysis
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 Video data collected in usability laboratories is usually }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid3945097 explain}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915  as it is observed Small
\par teams of evaluator\rquote s watch monitors showing what is being recorded in a control room
\par out of the users' sight. As they see errors or unusual behavior, one of the evaluators
\par marks the video and records a brief remark. When the test is finished evaluators can use
\par the annotated recording to calculate performance times so they can compared users'
\par performance on different prototypes. The data stream iron: the interaction log is used in
\par a similar way to calculate performance times. Typically this data is further analyzed using
\par simple statistics such as means, standard deviations, T-tests, etc. Categorized data may also
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13375915 {\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 be quantified and analyzed statistically, as we have said.}{\insrsid13375915\charrsid13375915 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043     }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 Question No: 39    ( Marks: 5 ) 
