0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{
\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043  Explain the following in context of problems with the web experience:
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 No sense of scale. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}No sense of location. 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043     }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 Question No: 40    ( Marks: 10 ) 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid2642536\charrsid15926043 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1064{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}
{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}\picscalex100\picscaley100\piccropl0\piccropr0\piccropt0\piccropb0
\picw15584\pich26\picwgoal8835\pichgoal15\wmetafile8\bliptag-1895836859\blipupi-161{\*\blipuid 8effd34580ace9d478c35331c42d728e}
010009000003b500000005001c00000000000400000003010800050000000b0200000000050000000c020d006c0e040000002e0118001c000000fb029cff0000
000000009001000000000440001254696d6573204e657720526f6d616e0000000000000000000000000000000000040000002d01000004000000020101000500
00000902000000020d000000320a5a00ffff01000400ffff0000670e0d0020f32d00030000001e0008000000fa0200000600000000000000040000002d010100
07000000fc020100000000000000040000002d0102000800000025030200040003005f0e030008000000fa0200000000000000000000040000002d0103000700
0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{
\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043  Explain the following planes of Conceptual Framework for developing an interactive product.
\par }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 The Structure Plane
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}The Scope Plane
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}The Surface Plane
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}The Strategy Plane
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13375915 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043     }{\b\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The Surface Plane
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 On the surface you see a series of Web pages, made up of images and text. Some of these
\par images are things you can click on, performing some sort of function such as taking you
\par to a shopping cart. Some of these images are just illustrations, such as a photograph of a
\par book cover or the logo of the site itself.
\par }{\b\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The Skeleton Plane
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 Beneath that surface is the skeleton of the site: the placement of buttons, tabs, photos, and
\par blocks of text. The skeleton is designed to optimize the arrangement of these elements for
\par maximum effect and efficiency-so that you remember the logo and can find that shopping
\par cart button when you need it.
\par }{\b\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The Structure Plane
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The skeleton is a }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024 real}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915  expression of the more abstract structure of the site. The
\par skeleton might define the placement of the interface elements on our checkout page; the
\par structure would define how users got to that page and where they could go when they
\par were finished there. The skeleton might define the arrangement of navigational items
\par allowing the users to browse categories of books; the structure would define what those
\par categories actually were.
\par }{\b\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The Scope Plane
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The structure defines the way in which the various features and functions of the site fit
\par together. Just what those features and functions are }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024 form}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915  the scope of the site. Some
\par sites that sell books offer a feature that enables users to save previously used addresses so
\par they can be used again. The question of whether that feature-or any feature-is included on
\par a site is a question of scope.}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043 
\par }{\b\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The Strategy Plane
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915 The scope is fundamentally determined by the strategy of the site. This strategy
\par }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024 incorporate}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915  not only what the people running the site want to get out of it but what the
\par users want to get out of the site as well. In the case of our bookstore example, some of the
\par strategic objectives are pretty obvious: Users want to buy books, and we want to sell
\par them. Other objectives might not be so easy to articulate.}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13375915\charrsid15926043 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043 Question No: 41    ( Marks: 10 ) 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid2642536\charrsid15926043 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1065{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}
{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}\picscalex100\picscaley100\piccropl0\piccropr0\piccropt0\piccropb0
\picw15584\pich26\picwgoal8835\pichgoal15\wmetafile8\bliptag-1895836859\blipupi-161{\*\blipuid 8effd34580ace9d478c35331c42d728e}
010009000003b500000005001c00000000000400000003010800050000000b0200000000050000000c020d006c0e040000002e0118001c000000fb029cff0000
000000009001000000000440001254696d6573204e657720526f6d616e0000000000000000000000000000000000040000002d01000004000000020101000500
00000902000000020d000000320a5a00ffff01000400ffff0000670e0d0020f32d00030000001e0008000000fa0200000600000000000000040000002d010100
07000000fc020100000000000000040000002d0102000800000025030200040003005f0e030008000000fa0200000000000000000000040000002d0103000700
0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{
\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid15926043  Explain the term \'93Accessibility\'94 with respect to Emerging Paradigms.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15032340 {\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 Accessibility is a term }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024 in}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340  which a system is usable by}{
\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 as many people as possible without modification. It is not to be confused with usability}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 
which is used to describe how easily a thing can be used by any type of user. One}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 meaning of accessibility specifically focuses on people with disabilities and their use of}{
\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 assistive devices such as screen-reading web browsers or wheelchairs. Other meanings}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14292024  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 are discussed below.
\par Accessibility is strongly related to universal design in that it is about making things as
\par accessible as possible to as wide a group of people as possible. However, products
\par marketed as having benefited from a Universal Design process are often actually the same
\par devices customized specifically for use by people with disabilities. It is rare to find a
\par Universally Designed product at the mass-market level that is used mostly by nondisabled
\par people.
\par The disability rights movement advocates equal access to social, political and economic
\par life which includes not only physical access but access to the same tools, organisations
\par and facilities which we all pay for.
\par A typical sign for wheelchair accessibility}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9461563  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 Accessibility is about giving equal access to
\par everyone.
\par While it is often used to describe facilities or amenities to assist people with disabilities,
\par as in "wheelchair accessible", the term can extend to Braille signage, wheelchair ramps,
\par audio signals at pedestrian crossings, walkway contours, website design, and so on.
\par Various countries have legislation requiring physical accessibility:
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9461563 {\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 In the UK, the Disability Discrimination Act 1995 has numerous provisions for}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9461563  }{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15032340 
accessibility.}{\f0\fs23\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15926043\charrsid9461563 
\par }}